snp5.1:41.1 starts: Ajita saw the Self-Awakened One,
snp5.1:41.2 starts: like the sun with radiance in beams,
snp5.1:41.3 starts: like the moon come to fullness
snp5.1:41.4 starts: on the fifteenth day.
snp5.1:12.1 starts: “That imposter,
snp5.1:12.2 starts: wanting money,
snp5.1:12.3 starts: has no knowledge of heads
snp5.1:12.4 starts: or the splitting of heads.”
snp5.1:13.1 starts: Bāvarī:
snp5.1:13.2 starts: Explain to me when asked:
snp5.1:13.3 starts: heads & the splitting of heads.
snp5.1:13.4 starts: I will listen to your words.”
snp5.1:23.1 starts: He whose appearance in the world
snp5.1:23.2 starts: is hard often to gain,
snp5.1:23.3 starts: has today arisen in the world,
snp5.1:23.4 starts: renowned as Self-Awakened.
snp5.1:23.5 starts: Going quickly to Sāvatthī,
snp5.1:23.6 starts: see the one supreme
snp5.1:25.1 starts: Bāvarī:
snp5.1:25.2 starts: the marks of a Great Man.
snp5.1:25.3 starts: Thirty-two are described in all,
snp5.1:25.4 starts: step by step.
snp5.1:29.1 starts: Ask just in your heart
snp5.1:29.2 starts: mantras, other students,
snp5.1:29.3 starts: and about heads
snp5.1:29.4 starts: & the splitting of heads.
snp5.1:46.1 starts: Ajita:
snp5.1:46.2 starts: Bāvarī’s marks—
snp5.1:46.3 starts: O man supreme,
snp5.1:46.4 starts: don’t leave us in doubt.”
snp5.1:48.1 starts: Not hearing anything asked,
snp5.1:48.2 starts: but hearing the questions answered,
snp5.1:48.3 starts: all the people, excited,
snp5.1:48.4 starts: with hands palm-to-palm over their hearts,
snp5.1:55.1 starts: All doubts—
snp5.1:55.2 starts: Bāvarī’s
snp5.1:55.3 starts: Ask, now that I’ve given leave,
snp5.1:55.4 starts: whatever you wish in your heart.”
